	measure 'Alt Decision Map' = "Scatter of all " & FORMAT( [Universe Valid], "#,0" ) & " rule-compliant portfolios by CAPEX and NPV to 2032. NPV falls as CAPEX rises; the Recommended plan is the cheapest compliant plan and has the highest NPV. Named plans show Low to High ranges. The bar chart next to it gives the same comparison for the five named plans."
		displayFolder: UX
